You put a lock on the closet?

203
00:07:30,039 --> 00:07:32,931
我打算抓到圣诞老人后 把他关在里面
That's where I'm gonna put Santa Claus when I catch him.

204
00:07:33,002 --> 00:07:35,420
给请他吃的饼干里加点安眠药
Sleeping pills in his cookies.

205
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:36,880
