Joe, who are you talking to?

206
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,480
天啊 我们俩小时前才把你送到学校
Oh, geez. We dropped you off at college two hours ago.

207
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,340
靠 海莉当时都比你待更久
My God, even Haley lasted longer.

208
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,300
