No, and I think I'm offended for you.

211
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:51,840
感觉像是你故意忘拿
It looks like you forgot that on purpose

212
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:54,140
好让你有借口回来安乐窝
so that you could come back to the nest.

213
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:55,340
哪有多"安乐"啊
Some "nest."

214
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:57,619
