你想当我的私人助理吗
You know, would you like to be my personal assistant?

286
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,120
平时要我做什么
What would I have to do?

287
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:35,120
除了帮我找个新老公
Apart from helping me find a new husband,

288
00:10:35,540 --> 00:10:38,920
大部分时间就是玩一玩 喝喝酒 去派对浪一浪
it's mostly... hanging out, drinking, going to parties.

289
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:40,620
我是完美人选
I am perfect for this.

290
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:41,940
有太多人可以为我举荐
I have so many references.

291
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,800
好的
Okay, uh...

292
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:46,960
那个在玩推圆盘游戏的怎么样 沃里斯先生
what about that guy going to play shuffleboard -- Mr. Voorhees?

293
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:49,540
他比我以前的那些老公年轻
Uh, he's a little younger than I normally do.

294
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:51,000
给你点参考 他向来
If it helps, he always orders

295
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,940
只点那些适合心脏病人的鸡尾酒
from the HeartSmart side of my cocktail menu.

296
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,160
你很在行啊
You are good at this.

297
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:56,940
让我去给他的心脏起搏器添加点压力
Let me go give that pacemaker something to do.

298
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,560
海莉 你应该在高尔夫球场端酒
Haley, you're supposed to be on the course serving drinks.

299
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:01,860
我很忙 卢克
I'm busy, Luke.

300
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:03,640
我们不能让客人清醒着打球
We can't have people golfing sober.

301
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,240
他们会发现那就是在浪费时间
They'll realize it's a waste of time.

302
00:11:05,740 --> 00:11:07,980
我不太想再继续当球车女郎了
I'm not even sure I want to be a cart girl anymore.

303
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,840
罗娜要我当她的私人助理
Rhonda asked me to be her personal assistant.

304
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:12,280
我知道这不算什么迷人的职业
I know this isn't the most glamorous job,

305
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:14,240
但是 这份工作提供的未来
but...it offers more of a future

306
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,140
比给色诱老男人换钱的女人当助理靠谱多了
than being an assistant to some gold digger.

307
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,120
喂
Hello?

308
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,820
好消息 沃里斯有个朋友
Hey, good news -- Voorhees has a friend,

309
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:23,140
他想带我们飞去旧金山玩 就今晚
and he wants to fly us all to San Francisco tonight.

310
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,560
这里能带你走向阳光大道
You're on a good path here.

311
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,999
你在赚钱 有很好的晋升机会
You're making money. There's opportunity for advancement.

312
00:11:26,999 --> 00:11:28,191
这趟旅行肯定很棒
It's gonna be great.

313
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:31,340
最豪华的酒店 最高档的餐厅 全天候护理
Best hotels, best restaurants, round-the-clock nursing.

314
00:11:31,419 --> 00:11:33,160
你比她强 海莉
You're better than her, Haley.

315
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,539
-算我一个 -很好
- I'm in. - ?Oh, good.

316
00:11:34,539 --> 00:11:37,228
车子五点钟来接我们 也就是吃完晚饭后
The car will pick us up at 5:00, right after dinner.

317
00:11:38,690 --> 00:11:40,040
我干嘛跟你浪费唇舌
Why do I even bother?

318
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,940
我跟你说的话你都右耳朵进
It's like what I say to you goes in one ear...

319
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:43,720
左耳朵出了
out the other.

320
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:51,640
不知道你是怎么样 我反正准备好独立生活了
Don't know about you, but I am ready to live on my own.

321
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:54,780
的确 照顾我的父母是艰巨的责任
Yep, it was a big responsibility taking care of my parents,

322
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,660
但是我也交棒给了一个可靠的人
but I left a good man on the job.

323
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,520
又来
Come on.

324
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:06,180
歌洛莉亚 你又把电视弄坏了 我看不了节目了
Gloria, you messed up the TV, and now I can't watch my program!

325
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:09,838
记得你让我在你像个老年人时提醒你吗
Remember how you told me to say something when you sound old?

326
00:12:09,838 --> 00:12:11,694
没事了 我弄好了
Ah, never mind. I fixed it.

327
00:12:12,865 --> 00:12:15,480
瞧瞧这些美丽的花儿
Look at those beautiful flowers.

328
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,300
哪儿来的
Where did they come from?

329
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:18,138
不知道
Not a clue.

330
00:12:18,138 --> 00:12:19,946
你弄的吧
Aww, you.

331
00:12:21,482 --> 00:12:22,685
乔
Joe?

332
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:24,460
你在做什么
What are you making?

333
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:27,500
纸上写了 这是一种古老的饮料
According to this, an ancient beverage

334
00:12:27,500 --> 00:12:29,600
苏丹王和流氓们都喜欢喝
enjoyed by sultans and scoundrels.

335
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:32,860
"捡报纸 做咖啡
"Bring in the paper, make coffee...

336
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:35,160
捡起杰的脏袜子"
pick up Jay's dirty socks."

337
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,160
你怎么在做这些事
Why are you doing all this?

338
00:12:37,660 --> 00:12:39,180
曼尼说以后这些都靠我了
Manny says it's my job now.

339
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,820
一直以来都是曼尼在做这些事吗
Manny was doing all these things?

340
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:43,940
我还很高兴你终于开始自己捡起脏袜子了
And I was so happy that you were picking up after yourself.

341
